      "name": "CsfFramework",
      "definition_uri": "https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-csf-v2/CsfFramework",
      "description": "One edition of the CSF as a whole: its functions, each holding its categories and their subcategories.",
      "from_schema": "https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-csf-v2",
      "see_also": [
        "https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/cswp/29/the-nist-cybersecurity-framework-csf-20/final"
