      "definition_uri": "https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-csf-v2/CsfSubcategory",
      "description": "A cybersecurity outcome: one statement of a result within a category, such as GV.OC-01, or a CSF 1.1 subcategory that CSF 2.0 withdrew, which the catalog keeps with its statement, its status and where it moved or what incorporated it.",
      "comments": [
        "A subcategory has no title of its own: its identifier names it and its statement is its description, which is why the description is required here."
      ],
